xmodel/grok-gluing-preflight-review.md:91:- The other coherent reading (printed `(g)/(h)` + forced `ν_G=ν_U`) *does* kill all four cells: a silent equal-`ν` re-enumeration of the same closure returns only `(9,15)` and `(10,15)` as T1-alive N1 budget-fitting cells. Sol's sentence at :547-548 (“the same four *records* are rejected”) is true of records. The surrounding cell-level language is not.
