+
+\[
+\mathbb F_p[T,W1^{\pm1},W2^{\pm1}]/
+(W1^4-c_{1,p},W2^4-c_{2,p}).
+\]
+
+Both constants are nonzero fourth powers and (p\equiv1\pmod8), so this is (16) copies of (mathbb F_p[T]). Restoring the four free lifts gives
