+Measured here, the full eight-base-pivot replay takes below 0.1 seconds and negligible memory; the terminal object is 8 rows, 14 variables, and 22 terms. A production FLINT/Singular implementation is plausibly only a few hundred lines. **CONJECTURE (performance):** the same pass will turn many D27+ “new residual over an old survivor” jobs into small Fitting/triangular problems before Gröbner machinery starts.
